<a2ui>
root=Column([a,b,c,h,r,z],gap="md",padding=16)
a=Text("A Bengaluru resident should dispose of a used laptop battery through a certified e-waste recycler, authorised collection centre, or verified manufacturer take-back/pickup service that explicitly accepts batteries. RecycleKaro lists Bengaluru drop-off and pickup options, EcoFlyp lists multiple Bengaluru organisations and drop-off points that accept batteries, and RecycleKaro’s guidance specifically says to use CPCB or KSPCB-authorized recyclers.",variant="body")
b=Text("Approved collection options","h2")
c=Card([d])
d=Column([e,f,g],"sm",padding=16)
e=Text("Drop-off at a certified recycler or collection centre: Bengaluru options listed in the search results include RecycleKaro’s Bengaluru facility, Saahas, Croma stores, and other listed recyclers/collection points that accept batteries.","caption")
f=Text("Scheduled home pickup: RecycleKaro and EcoFlyp both describe pickup services, and Zolopik also offers pickup for battery/e-waste collection in Bengaluru.","caption")
g=Text("Manufacturer or brand take-back: Some brands and authorised partners offer battery/e-waste return programs, including brand-linked collection or pickup arrangements.","caption")
h=Text("Storage precautions before handing it over","h2")
i=Card([j])
j=Column([k,l,m,n,o],"sm",padding=16)
k=Text("Keep the battery separate from regular waste and do not put it in household garbage.","label")
l=Text("Store it in a cool, dry place away from heat, sunlight, and moisture; keep it out of reach of children and pets.","label")
m=Text("Do not puncture, crush, bend, or open it; if it is swollen or damaged, handle it especially carefully and do not force it.","label")
n=Text("Tape the terminals if it is loose and place it in a non-conductive container or bag to reduce the risk of short-circuiting.","label")
o=Text("Do not keep it near metal objects such as coins, keys, or tools that could bridge the terminals.","label")
p=Text("What to verify before handing it over","h2")
q=Card([r])
r=Column([s,t,u,v,w,x],"sm",padding=16)
s=Text("Authorization: Confirm that the recycler or pickup service is CPCB/KSPCB-authorized or otherwise clearly certified.","label")
t=Text("Battery acceptance: Verify that the centre accepts laptop batteries specifically, since some points accept only certain categories of e-waste.","label")
u=Text("Pickup/drop-off terms: Check whether it is a free drop-off, scheduled pickup, or paid service, and whether any minimum quantity applies.","label")
v=Text("Receipt or confirmation: Ask for written or digital proof that the battery was received for lawful recycling or disposal.","label")
w=Text("Data-related items: If you are also handing over the laptop, back up data, sign out of accounts, and factory reset the device first; this is less relevant for the battery alone but important if the laptop is included.","label")
x=Text("Condition reporting: Tell the handler whether the battery is swollen, leaking, or physically damaged so they can apply the right handling process.","label")
y=Text("If you want, I can also help you find the nearest Bengaluru drop-off option from the listed centres and pick the most convenient one.","caption")
</a2ui>